  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Expert - DG INTPA Private sector, engagement and employment, Bryssel</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Nationell Expert - DG INTPA Privatsektor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The position will contribute to the team&apos;s work on developing engagement with the private sector and support colleagues working with a geographical focus, as well as assist EU delegations in identifying private sector stakeholders and business-related information in third countries. The role will particularly focus on supporting the implementation of the EU-Africa Business Forum (EABF) and the Global Gateway Business Advisory Group (GG BAG).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Tj&#xe4;nsten ska bidra till teamets arbete med att utveckla arbetet med den privata sektorn och st&#xf6;dja kollegor som arbetar med geografiskt fokus samt st&#xf6;dja arbetet p&#xe5; EU-delegationerna i att identifiera arbetet med att identifiera privata sektorns intressenter och aff&#xe4;rsinformation i tredje land. Tj&#xe4;nsten fokuserar s&#xe4;rskilt p&#xe5; att st&#xf6;tta implementeringen av EU-Africa Business Forum (EABF) och implementeringen av the Global Gateway Business Advisory Group (GG BAG).</narrative>
  </description>
